no more manual imports",[],{"dimensions":108,"alt":109,"copyright":42,"url":110,"id":111,"edit":112},{"width":96,"height":96},"Icon of a clock","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F40f1b5ea-7a5c-44d7-8e16-86d427c88a1d_its_too_late1.svg","Yh96GBIAACoA-Zsp",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":55},{"title":114,"content":115,"icon":119},"Send UK & international parcels",[116],{"type":33,"text":117,"spans":118,"direction":36},"Book and manage UK and international parcels in the same place with ease",[],{"dimensions":120,"alt":121,"copyright":42,"url":122,"id":123,"edit":124},{"width":96,"height":96},"Above and beyond icon","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41bf8079-3dd8-48b6-ad6b-013e68421339_above_and_beyond.svg","YflBvREAACIA8pXG",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"title":126,"content":127,"icon":131},"Set parcel details",[128],{"type":33,"text":129,"spans":130,"direction":36},"Store your delivery preferences and defaults on parcel weight, size, cover, and more",[],{"dimensions":132,"alt":133,"copyright":42,"url":134,"id":135,"edit":136},{"width":96,"height":96},"Icon of a parcel","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg","Yh96FhIAAC4A-Zr2",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":55},{"title":138,"content":139,"icon":143},"Dispatch confirmation",[140],{"type":33,"text":141,"spans":142,"direction":36},"We confirm your Etsy orders as ‘dispatched’, and we’ll even automatically update the tracking details to keep your customers updated",[],{"dimensions":144,"alt":145,"copyright":42,"url":146,"id":147,"edit":148},{"width":96,"height":96},"Phone icon","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":55},{"title":150,"content":151,"icon":155},"FREE end-to-end tracking",[152],{"type":33,"text":153,"spans":154,"direction":36},"Full online parcel tracking for both you and your customers, which means less time spent dealing with “where’s my parcel?” queries",[],{"dimensions":156,"alt":157,"copyright":42,"url":158,"id":159,"edit":160},{"width":96,"height":96},"Track location icon","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg","Yh96FRIAACgA-Zrj",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":55},{"theme":29,"title":162,"description":42},"Why use bulk send?","list_block$dc43c513-fd0a-4298-9580-925a485c8891","list_block",{"variation":166,"version":25,"items":167,"primary":215,"id":218,"slice_type":164,"slice_label":42},"listNoIcon",[168,184,190,196,209],{"title":169,"content":170,"isNumbered":183},"Visit bulk send",[171],{"type":33,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":36},"Log in to your Evri account and go to your bulk send dashboard.",[174,181],{"start":175,"end":176,"type":177,"data":178},43,62,"hyperlink",{"link_type":39,"url":179,"target":180},"\u002Fcustomer\u002Fbulk-upload","_blank",{"start":175,"end":176,"type":182},"strong",true,{"title":185,"content":186,"isNumbered":183},"Choose Etsy to link with your Evri account",[187],{"type":33,"text":188,"spans":189,"direction":36},"Follow the step-by-step instructions - they’re a little different for each marketplace",[],{"title":191,"content":192,"isNumbered":183},"Set your UK parcel defaults",[193],{"type":33,"text":194,"spans":195,"direction":36},"You'll need to set these for UK parcels before you can set international parcels.",[],{"title":197,"content":198,"isNumbered":183},"Set your international parcel defaults",[199],{"type":33,"text":200,"spans":201,"direction":36},"Scroll to \"sending international parcels?\" and select \"get started\" to set your international parcel defaults.",[202,206],{"start":203,"end":204,"type":205},11,41,"em",{"start":207,"end":208,"type":205},55,66,{"title":210,"content":211,"isNumbered":183},"Automatic order importing",[212],{"type":33,"text":213,"spans":214,"direction":36},"Your Etsy orders will auto-import, ready for you to start booking UK and international parcels in one place",[],{"theme":29,"title":216,"description":217,"showPaddingTop":20},"How to use Evri integrations","Using our bulk send tool is easy. Connect your Etsy seller account to Evri, and you can book deliveries for all your orders directly in one place:","list_block$d7d3fec7-33d7-4369-9bbc-7cc69f5d9172",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":220,"primary":221,"id":234,"slice_type":235,"slice_label":42},[],{"title":222,"bodyText":223,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":20,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":42,"buttonLink":227,"image":228},"Are you VAT registered?",[224],{"type":33,"text":225,"spans":226,"direction":36},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"link_type":44},{"dimensions":229,"alt":230,"copyright":42,"url":231,"id":232,"edit":233},{"width":67,"height":68},"A father is weighing his parcel at home at his desk using a set of digital scales. His children are resting on the sofa behind him.","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdApbqstJ9-inY_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7772.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdApbqstJ9-inY",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},"feature_banner$b6129255-82cc-406b-b171-05915314395a","feature_banner",{"variation":237,"version":25,"items":238,"primary":300,"id":311,"slice_type":312,"slice_label":42},"3Column",[239,261,281],{"Title":240,"Description":245,"Image":249,"Label":42,"UrlText":243,"Url":257,"buttonDataGtmTrack":42,"SecondaryButtonText":42,"SecondaryButtonUrl":260,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":42,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[241],{"type":242,"text":243,"spans":244},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[246],{"type":33,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":36},"Choose from 9,000+ ParcelShops in corner shops, Post Offices, and more. Print your label at home or use our free Print In ParcelShop devices, then drop off your parcel for collection.",[],{"dimensions":250,"alt":252,"copyright":42,"url":253,"id":254,"edit":255},{"width":67,"height":251},665,"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":53,"y":256,"zoom":54,"background":73},8,{"link_type":39,"key":258,"url":259},"45b3210b-eb2e-4f7d-bdfa-f9eeec6385cc","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":44},{"Title":262,"Description":266,"Image":270,"Label":42,"UrlText":264,"Url":277,"buttonDataGtmTrack":42,"SecondaryButtonText":42,"SecondaryButtonUrl":280,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":42,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[263],{"type":242,"text":264,"spans":265},"Lockers",[],[267],{"type":33,"text":268,"spans":269,"direction":36},"Find your nearest Locker online, open 24\u002F7 and located across the UK. Scan your parcel barcode, place your parcels in one of the secure Lockers available, and we’ll take care of the rest.",[],{"dimensions":271,"alt":272,"copyright":42,"url":273,"id":274,"edit":275},{"width":67,"height":251},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":53,"y":276,"zoom":54,"background":73},17,{"link_type":39,"key":278,"url":279},"d0f6f736-7499-4686-8231-9b776da5521d","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":44},{"Title":282,"Description":286,"Image":290,"Label":42,"UrlText":284,"Url":296,"buttonDataGtmTrack":42,"SecondaryButtonText":42,"SecondaryButtonUrl":299,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":42,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[283],{"type":242,"text":284,"spans":285},"Courier collection",[],[287],{"type":33,"text":288,"spans":289,"direction":36},"Book a courier to collect your parcels at your convenience, whether you're at home or at work. We’ll provide a 1-hour collection window on the day to make sure you're ready for their arrival.",[],{"dimensions":291,"alt":292,"copyright":42,"url":293,"id":294,"edit":295},{"width":67,"height":251},"A customer has just handed their parcel to an Evri courier as a part of a doorstep collection. The customer is being handed a blue slip as a receipt of the transaction.","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xsZbqstJ9-pVA_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1545.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8158%2C5425&w=1000&h=665","Z69xsZbqstJ9-pVA",{"x":53,"y":256,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"link_type":39,"key":297,"url":298},"e19d89bd-eba0-462c-a150-a1aa0fb41a6e","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":44},{"SectionTitle":301,"SectionDescription":306,"theme":310},[302],{"type":303,"text":304,"spans":305,"direction":36},"heading2","Send Etsy orders with Evri",[],[307],{"type":33,"text":308,"spans":309,"direction":36},"Etsy sellers can choose to drop off at 10,000+ locations or arrange a collection from their front door. Book your parcels online using our three easy ways to send:",[],"neutral","article_link_module$05eb0fa3-a5b0-45a3-87aa-e26dfd890a88","article_link_module",{"variation":314,"version":25,"items":315,"primary":424,"id":428,"slice_type":429,"slice_label":42},"fullList",[316,325,334,342,351,359,367,375,383,391,399,408,416],{"integrationLogo":317,"integrationDescription":42},{"dimensions":318,"alt":321,"copyright":42,"url":322,"id":323,"edit":324},{"width":319,"height":320},192,59,"amazon logo","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002