 logo","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZz27fa8jQArT1EJW_tiktok.svg","Zz27fa8jQArT1EJW",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"integrationLogo":417,"integrationDescription":42},{"dimensions":418,"alt":420,"copyright":42,"url":421,"id":422,"edit":423},{"width":419,"height":329},120,"woocommerce logo","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F893beb1f-0cae-4500-bd57-64211ada5190_woocommerce.svg","YvNtAxIAACIAf6B3",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"title":425,"description":426,"buttonText":42,"buttonUrl":427},"Link more accounts with Evri","Not just an Etsy seller? Our bulk send tool connects with multiple platforms, so you can manage all your online orders from one place. \nWe’re always adding more integrations to our service, so if your marketplace or ecommerce platform isn’t on the list, watch this space for further updates.",{"link_type":44},"integrations_block$4c451dfd-ce09-4e55-aa95-2c9d5e38deba","integrations_block",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":431,"primary":433,"id":449,"slice_type":84,"slice_label":42},[432],{},{"CardImage":434,"CardAvatar":74,"CardTitle":440,"CardText":441,"ButtonText":445,"ButtonUrl":446,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":435,"alt":436,"copyright":42,"url":437,"id":438,"edit":439},{"width":67,"height":68},"A customer is crouched on the floor of their apartment, holding items in one hand and is about to place them in the box in front of them.","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XrypbqstJ9-WeK_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5211.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XrypbqstJ9-WeK",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},"A guide for Etsy sellers",[442],{"type":33,"text":443,"spans":444,"direction":36},"Whether you're new to selling or looking to expand your online store, our guide provides all the tools you need to succeed on Etsy. Learn how to start your Etsy shop from your laptop, discover top-selling items, and get essential tips to maximise your sales.",[],"Find out more",{"link_type":39,"key":447,"url":448},"fa8aef79-b230-4a3b-8519-b41d02e557e1","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-sell-on-etsy","card$4caeb6c3-ce25-47c0-8910-d020ed670c77",{"variation":451,"version":25,"items":452,"primary":501,"id":505,"slice_type":506,"slice_label":42},"default",[453,469,485],{"title":454,"content":455,"icon":459,"link":465,"linkLabel":445,"backgroundColor":468},"Evri Standard Account",[456],{"type":33,"text":457,"spans":458,"direction":36},"Enjoy all the features of an Evri account, plus get access to great savings when you spend £30+, collect Tesco Clubcard points, and subscribe to our marketing for exclusive offers.",[],{"dimensions":460,"alt":461,"copyright":42,"url":462,"id":463,"edit":464},{"width":96,"height":96},"Parcel icon","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F15159101-ea95-4f4d-8762-549a8e631c4f_parcel3.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsn",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"link_type":39,"key":466,"url":467},"c323e925-7143-436e-8b9a-7b2db5808bc5","\u002Fstandard-account","neutral-01",{"title":470,"content":471,"icon":475,"link":481,"linkLabel":484,"backgroundColor":468},"Evri Frequent Seller Account",[472],{"type":33,"text":473,"spans":474,"direction":36},"Made for growing small businesses, this is a free, no-commitment account upgrade that gives you up to 50% off UK deliveries and 20% off international deliveries when you send 40+ parcels per month.",[],{"dimensions":476,"alt":477,"copyright":42,"url":478,"id":479,"edit":480},{"width":96,"height":96},"Large parcel icon","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F97975357-8cb0-4e5c-8466-86156e50fd76_parcel2.svg","Yh96FRIAAC8A-Zrt",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"link_type":39,"key":482,"url":483},"5a61607f-1570-4ade-92d6-cbea65596bbe","\u002Ffrequent-seller","Learn more",{"title":486,"content":487,"icon":491,"link":497,"linkLabel":500,"backgroundColor":468},"Evri Business Account",[488],{"type":33,"text":489,"spans":490,"direction":36},"Growing fast and regularly sending 150+ parcels per week? Get regular van collections, discounted pricing, and enhanced customer service with a dedicated Evri Business Account.",[],{"dimensions":492,"alt":493,"copyright":42,"url":494,"id":495,"edit":496},{"width":96,"height":96},"Icon of a lorry turning left","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F368d77c0-145d-4481-a619-4399e853d1cb_lorry+-+facing+left.svg","Yh96FhIAAC8A-Zr6",{"x":53,"y":53,"zoom":54,"background":73},{"link_type":39,"key":498,"url":499},"0cf40625-c41f-4e2e-a23f-0a746bdc1095","\u002Fbusiness\u002Fenquiry-form\u002Fbusiness-details","Enquire today",{"sectionTitle":502,"sectionDescription":503,"linksStyle":504},"An account to suit you","Looking for an affordable, reliable way to send parcels across the UK and internationally? We have everything you need.","primary","feature_link_cards_promo$738ce6c0-2d69-4181-aed0-9344e8a3297e","feature_link_cards_promo",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":508,"primary":510,"id":519,"slice_type":520,"slice_label":42},[509],{},{"heading":511,"description":512,"image":513},"Give your customers a GREAT service with us","We're rated a GREAT 4.1 out of 5 on Trustpilot with over 4 million 5-star reviews. We handle anything from individual packages to providing courier services for most of the UK’s top brands like Amazon, John Lewis and Next. Etsy sellers can count on us to keep customers happy and ratings high with a great experience.",{"dimensions":514,"alt":515,"copyright":42,"url":516,"id":517,"edit":518},{"width":67,"height":251},"View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house.","etsy-integration.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_799